# ADR-005's backpressure signal, on the wire. `finished evicted` names the collector's
# FinishReason and lets each plane derive its own word -- which is the only way this gate can
# catch a plane that invents a different one. It could not before: `reason` STATES the string,
# so both planes echoed it unchanged and the C++ mapping was never exercised. That mapping
# wrote `failed` for this outcome, so a consumer alarming on an eviction saw nothing from a
# C++ shard.
scenario evicted_frame
camera cam_loud
frame 41
source shard-3
size 1920 1080
fps 20.0
missing person_embedder ship_embedder
finished evicted

person cam_loud_41_0 0.5 10 20 30 40
